OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786963675
OL,3,CHeroes and Nashville actress Hayden
OL,4,CPanettiere dies aged 36
OL,6,FUS actress Hayden Panettiere, best
OL,7,Fknown for her roles in Heroes and
OL,8,FNashville, has died aged 36.
OL,10,FA representative for the actress
OL,11,Fconfirmed her death, sharing a
OL,12,Fstatement from her father Skip who
OL,13,Fsaid her family would remember her
OL,14,F"incredible light".
OL,16,F"It is with profound sadness that we
OL,17,Fshare the tragic passing of our
OL,18,Fbeloved Hayden," the statement read.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
