OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786963675
OL,3,CHeroes and Nashville actress Hayden
OL,4,CPanettiere dies aged 36
OL,6,F"She was an incredible light and a
OL,7,Fforce of nature who brought
OL,8,Fimmeasurable love and joy to all who
OL,9,Fknew her ` and to the millions who
OL,10,Fwatched her onscreen."
OL,12,FHer father also asked that her family
OL,13,Fbe given privacy as they "take time to
OL,14,Fprocess this unimaginable loss".
OL,16,FPanettiere had a daughter, Kaya, aged
OL,17,F11.
OL,19,FNo cause of death has been announced.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
