OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786963675
OL,3,CHeroes and Nashville actress Hayden
OL,4,CPanettiere dies aged 36
OL,6,FPanettiere began acting as a child,
OL,7,Fappearing in soap operas before
OL,8,Fgaining wider recognition for her role
OL,9,Fin the 2000 sports drama Remember The
OL,10,FTitans alongside Denzel Washington and
OL,11,Fas the voice of Dot in Pixar's 1998
OL,12,Ffilm A Bug's Life.
OL,14,FShe later found fame playing
OL,15,Fcheerleader Claire Bennet in the
OL,16,Fsuperhero drama Heroes before going on
OL,17,Fto star as up-and-coming country
OL,18,Fsinger Juliette Barnes for six seasons
OL,19,Fon the hit TV series Nashville.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
