OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786963675
OL,3,CHeroes and Nashville actress Hayden
OL,4,CPanettiere dies aged 36
OL,6,FHer performances in Nashville earned
OL,7,Fher two Golden Globe nominations for
OL,8,Fbest supporting actress, while her
OL,9,Fsinging on the show produced 11
OL,10,Fentries on the US Billboard Hot
OL,11,FCountry Songs charts.
OL,13,FPanettiere's film credits include
OL,14,F2006's Bring It On: All Or Nothing,
OL,15,Fcomedy-drama film Raising Helen, and
OL,16,Fappearances in Scream 4 and Scream VI
OL,17,Fas Kirby Reed.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
