OL,3,CHeroes and Nashville actress Hayden
OL,4,CPanettiere dies aged 36
OL,6,FThe actress had previously revealed
OL,7,Fher struggles with addiction
OL,8,Fthroughout her 20s following her rapid
OL,9,Frise to fame.
OL,11,FIn a memoir published earlier this
OL,12,Fyear, Panettiere also opened up about
OL,13,Fher difficulties with mental health
OL,14,Fand the loss of her younger brother,
OL,15,FJansen, who died of a heart condition
OL,16,Fin 2023 aged 28.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
