OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786963675
OL,3,CHeroes and Nashville actress Hayden
OL,4,CPanettiere dies aged 36
OL,6,FShe also talked about her decision to
OL,7,Fgive full custody of her daughter to
OL,8,Fher former partner, Ukrainian boxer
OL,9,FWladimir Klitschko.
OL,11,F"The idea that anyone would think that
OL,12,FI would just give away my child and be
OL,13,Fokay with it is heartbreaking and
OL,14,Fcouldn't be further from the truth,"
OL,15,Fshe told podcaster Jay Shetty after
OL,16,Fthe release of her memoir in May.
OL,18,FPanettiere said her daughter had lived
OL,19,Fwith her father full-time from a young
OL,20,Fage amid the actresses' struggles with
OL,21,Faddiction and mental health.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
