OL,3,CHeroes and Nashville actress Hayden
OL,4,CPanettiere dies aged 36
OL,6,FShe said: "I was struggling with
OL,7,Fmental health and anxiety and the
OL,8,Fpostpartum and having to act my way
OL,9,Fthrough it and just feeling like I
OL,10,Fcompletely lost myself."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/7
